package com.soukmar.app.ui.model

// Single source of truth for the site-wide "which country am I browsing/
// listing in" concept (Listing.country) — mirrors soukmar/src/app/models/
// country.model.ts and soukmar-backend/src/lib/countries.ts EXACTLY (same
// COUNTRIES array, same CITIES_BY_COUNTRY curated set). Generated from the
// web source via a one-off script rather than hand-transcribed, to avoid
// data-entry drift across ~193 countries. If the web list changes, re-run
// the extraction rather than editing this file by hand.
//
// Codes are ISO 3166-1 alpha-2, same as web, so this stays interchangeable
// with the backend's Listing.country column. Country *names* are never
// hand-translated here — java.util.Locale("", code).getDisplayCountry(uiLocale)
// is the JVM's Intl.DisplayNames equivalent (CLDR-backed), used at call
// sites instead of a hardcoded name table.

enum class ContinentRegion { MOROCCO, AFRICA, EUROPE, ASIA, NORTH_AMERICA, SOUTH_AMERICA, OCEANIA }

data class CountryInfo(val code: String, val region: ContinentRegion, val currency: String)

